<title>USA: Checkers names William Foley chairman.</title>
<headline>Checkers names William Foley chairman.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkers Drive-In Restaurants said Monday it named William Foley chairman, replacing Frederick Fisher.</p>
<p>The company said Fisher will remain on the board. Foley is chairman of Fidelity National Financial Inc and CKE Restaurants Inc.</p>
<p>Earlier Monday, Checkers and Rally's Hamburgers Inc said they had terminated merger negotiations.</p>
<p>Checkers, along with its franchisees, operates 478 restaurants located mainly in the southeastern U.S.</p>
